    "result_text": "The full test suite passes \u2014 `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class with tests, and both its tests are green. `BUILD SUCCESS`.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipTier` business rule: `SILVER` when `namesakeCount` is 0 and an email is present, otherwise `BRONZE`.\n\nChanges, following the existing derived-field pattern (`membershipNumber`):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the read-only `membershipTier` property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 added a static `membershipTier(Integer namesakeCount, String email)` helper holding the rule (null-safe: a null count or missing/empty email yields `BRONZE`).\n\n3. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` for `membershipTier` plus the `formatMembershipTier(owner)` default method delegating to `Owner.membershipTier(...)`.\n\nBoth acceptance tests (`coreSilverWhenUniqueWithEmail`, `functionalityBronzeWhenNoEmail`) and the full suite pass.",
